      "content": "idk, the advice feels a bit hollow when everything feels so... empty. like, what if there actually isn't an anchor? what if the drifting is just how things are meant to be? sometimes the idea of just disappearing into that quiet, nothing space feels more peaceful than fighting to stay tethered to things that don't even matter. it's almost like a relief to think about.",
